 $('#sidebar').innerHTML=`<a class="brand" href="#home"><img src="./icon.svg" alt=""><div><div class="brand-title">弁理士合格ラボ</div><div class="brand-sub">BENRISHI STUDY LAB</div></div></a><div class="nav-label">YOUR LEARNING SPACE</div><nav class="nav-list">${navItems.map(([id,ic,n])=>`<button class="nav-item ${route===id||route.startsWith(id+'/')?'active':''}" data-nav="${id}">${icon(ic)}<span>${n}</span>${id==='review'&&dueIds().length?`<b class="nav-count">${dueIds().length}</b>`:''}</button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="sidebar-tip"><strong>今日の一歩が、明日の自信。</strong>読む、理解する、解いて確かめる。<br>あなたのペースで、着実に。</div><button class="nav-item" data-nav="settings">${icon('settings')}設定・オフライン</button><div class="sidebar-caption">学習記録はこの端末に保存</div></div>`;
